From 56b81e9879f1b459a2a671613323c8493ff98d25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:08:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/23] feat(web): make buyer AI proactively ask
 budget/use-case and show cards

Strengthen the shopping-agent system prompt so a vague purchase intent
triggers clickable ask_user questions (budget tier first, then use-case,
max two follow-up turns) before tool-based retrieval, and make
show_products the default after a successful search. Sharpen the
ask_user/show_products tool descriptions, align the root quick prompt
with the car-shop demo scenario, and document a sponsor demo script for
challenge #11. Guard the demo-critical prompt lines with test
assertions.
---
